### vNext Monitor API — REST Client (VS Code / IntelliJ)
### Taban: BBT.Workflow.Monitor.HttpApi.Host, varsayılan port 4203
### Bileşenler: ?type= zorunlu; opsiyonel ?key= (tek kayıt), ?version=

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4203
@apiVersion = 1.0
@domain = core
@workflow = lifecycle-transitions-test-workflow
@instance = 8e298c72-457c-4cd2-b3f2-e94fd5bf5a41
@transitionId = b739cc23-45d2-4371-af6a-3c29b83eac13
@taskId = 660e8400-e29b-41d4-a716-446655440111

### Instance listesi (sayfalı)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances?page=1&pageSize=10

### Instance — meta + correlations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instance}}

### Instance data — veri + versiyon geçmişi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instance}}/data

### Instance data — belirli versiyon
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instance}}/data?version=1.1.0

### Instance view — mevcut state'in görünümü
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instance}}/view

### Instance view — belirli transition'ın görünümü
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instance}}/view?transitionKey=approve

### Instance timeline — tüm geçiş akışı
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instance}}/timeline

### Instance timeline — task'lar her geçişe gömülü
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instance}}/timeline?includeTasks=true

### Instance timeline — tek bir transition'ın detayı
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instance}}/timeline?transitionId={{transitionId}}

### Instance timeline — tek transition + task'ları gömülü
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instance}}/timeline?transitionId={{transitionId}}&includeTasks=true

### Instance timeline — tek bir task kaydı
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instance}}/timeline?taskId={{taskId}}

### Instance state — anlık durum + yapılabilir geçişler
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instance}}/state

### Instance fault detayı
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instance}}/faults

### Instance incidents — error boundary incident geçmişi (en yeni önce, max 5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instance}}/incidents

### Instance data diff — iki versiyon arası fark
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instance}}/data/diff?from=1.0.0&to=1.1.0

### Instance hierarchy — alt-süreç ağacı
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instance}}/hierarchy

### Components — özet liste (key, version, domain, labels, type); tam tanım yok — 1. sayfa, 20 kayıt
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components?type=sys-flows

### Components — özet liste — 2. sayfa
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components?type=sys-flows&page=2&pageSize=20

### Components — özet liste — task bileşenleri
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components?type=sys-tasks

### Components — tek component detayı (key verilince: flow, versions, type, labels)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components?type=sys-flows&key={{workflow}}

### Components — tek component detayı — belirli versiyon
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components?type=sys-flows&key={{workflow}}&version=1.0.0

### Components — workflow tanımı (en son versiyon) — tek definition nesnesi döner (items wrapper yok)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components/definition?type=sys-flows&key=account-opening-workflow

### Components — belirli versiyon — tek definition nesnesi döner (items wrapper yok)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components/definition?type=sys-flows&key=account-opening-workflow&version=1.0.0

### Components — bir tipin tüm tanımları
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components/definition?type=sys-flows

### Components — 400: definition'da key ile page/pageSize kullanılamaz
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components/definition?type=sys-flows&key={{workflow}}&page=2

### Components — createdAt range filter (sys-flows)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components?type=sys-flows&createdAt[gte]=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&createdAt[lte]=2026-06-01T00:00:00Z

### Components — renderer filter (sys-views only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components?type=sys-views&renderer=default

### Components — display + renderer combined (sys-views)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components?type=sys-views&display=form&renderer=default

### Components — scope filter (sys-functions)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components?type=sys-functions&scope=global

### Components — name contains filter (sys-mappings)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components?type=sys-mappings&name[contains]=order

### Components — name exact filter (sys-mappings)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components?type=sys-mappings&name[eq]=Order Processing Scripts

### Components — tags contains filter (sys-tasks)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components?type=sys-tasks&tags[contains]=notification

### Components — key exact filter (filter mode, returns list)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components?type=sys-flows&key[eq]=order-approval-flow

### Components — key contains filter (partial key search)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components?type=sys-flows&key[contains]=order

### Components — flowVersion exact filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components?type=sys-flows&flowVersion[eq]=1.0.0

### Components — flowVersion contains filter (all 1.x versions)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components?type=sys-flows&flowVersion[contains]=1.0

### Components — definitionType filter (sys-flows)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components?type=sys-flows&definitionType=F

### Components — 400: renderer on sys-flows (unsupported filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components?type=sys-flows&renderer=default

### Components — version exact filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components?type=sys-flows&version[eq]=1.0.0

### Components — version contains filter (all 1.x)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components?type=sys-flows&version[contains]=1.0

### Components — 400: both [eq] and [contains] for same field (conflict)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components?type=sys-flows&key[eq]=order-flow&key[contains]=order

### Components — 400: version [eq] and [contains] conflict
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components?type=sys-flows&version[eq]=1.0.0&version[contains]=1.0

### Component versions — belirli bir workflow'un tüm versiyonlarını sayfalı listele
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components/versions?type=sys-flows&key={{workflow}}

### Component versions — belirli bir workflow versiyonları, ikinci sayfa
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components/versions?type=sys-flows&key={{workflow}}&page=2&pageSize=10

### Component versions — sys-tasks bileşeni için versiyon listesi
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/components/versions?type=sys-tasks&key=my-task-key

### Workflow versions alias — workflow-centric route (type implicit sys-flows)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/versions

### Workflow versions alias — ikinci sayfa
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/versions?page=2&pageSize=10

### Stats — workflow instance sayaçları
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/stats/instances

### Stats — workflow instance sayaçları — belirli workflow versiyonu
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/stats/instances?version=1.0.0

### Stats — workflow instance sayaçları — GraphQL filter ile tarih aralığı
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/stats/instances?filter={"createdAt":{"ge":"2026-05-18T00:00:00Z"}}

### Stats — workflow instance sayaçları — GraphQL filter ile state kısıtı
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/stats/instances?filter={"currentState":{"eq":"approve"}}

### Stats — workflow instance sayaçları — filter + version aynı anda (400 döner)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/stats/instances?filter={"createdAt":{"ge":"2026-05-18T00:00:00Z"}}&version=1.0.0

### Stats — domain instance sayaçları (default: son 7 günde başlatılanlar)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/stats/instances

### Stats — domain instance sayaçları — son 30 gün (createdAt aralığı)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/stats/instances?filter={"createdAt":{"ge":"2026-05-18T00:00:00Z"}}

### Stats — domain instance sayaçları — belirli tarih aralığı (between)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/stats/instances?filter={"createdAt":{"between":["2026-03-01T00:00:00Z","2026-06-01T00:00:00Z"]}}

### Stats — domain instance sayaçları — tarih + ek alan (createdAt yoksa son 7 gün otomatik AND'lenir)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/stats/instances?filter={"currentState":{"eq":"approve"}}

### Stats — canlı state dağılımı
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/stats/states

### Stats — canlı state dağılımı — belirli workflow versiyonu
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/stats/states?version=1.0.0

### Stats — hata istatistikleri (faulted breakdown)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/stats/faults

### Stats — task çalıştırma istatistikleri
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/stats/tasks

### Stats — instance tamamlanma süresi istatistikleri
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/stats/duration

### Stats — geçiş istatistikleri (akış yoğunluğu dahil)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/stats/transitions

### Stats — domain component sayım özeti (flow, task, schema, view, function, extension)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/stats/components

### Workflow bağımlılıkları — hangi component'lara bağımlı?
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/dependencies

### Workflow bağımlılıkları — belirli versiyon
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/dependencies?version=1.0.0

### Instance parent — subflow'dan parent'a ters navigasyon
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instance}}/parent

### Instance tasks — instance'ın çalıştırdığı tüm task'ler (transition bağlamıyla)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instance}}/tasks

### Instance task detail — tek task detayı (tanım, tetikleyici slot, girdi/çıktı)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instance}}/tasks/{{taskEntityId}}

### Functions — domain-scope function tanımları (domain geneli, kayıt gerektirmez)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/functions/scope

### Functions — instance'ın workflow'unda kayıtlı function tanımları
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instance}}/functions/scope

### Aktif job'lar — workflow bazlı
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/jobs

### Aktif job'lar — domain geneli (best-effort)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/jobs

### Runtime config (secret'sız)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/config

### Yetkilendirme — workflow yetki matrisi (tümü)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/permissions

### Yetkilendirme — workflow matrisi, role göre filtreli
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/permissions?role=morph-idm.maker

### Yetkilendirme — instance mevcut durumu üzerinden izin görünümü
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instance}}/permissions

### Yetkilendirme — instance izin görünümü, role göre filtreli
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instance}}/permissions?role=morph-idm.maker

### Yetkilendirme — instance izin görünümü, belirli flow versiyonuna göre
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{instance}}/permissions?version=1.0.0

### Yetkilendirme — yalnızca transition rolleri (alt görünüm)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/permissions/transitions

### Yetkilendirme — yalnızca function rolleri (alt görünüm)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/monitor/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/permissions/functions

### Health detail (API sürüm segmenti yok)
GET {{baseUrl}}/monitor/health/detail

### Özet sağlık / ready / live / version / metrics (sürüm segmenti yok)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
GET {{baseUrl}}/ready
GET {{baseUrl}}/live
GET {{baseUrl}}/version
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics
